				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5162</guid>
				<title>SCP-5162</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5162</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5162&lt;br /&gt;
Class: Keter&lt;br /&gt;
Codenames: The Decaying Savanna, The Death Fields, and The Monochrome Decay&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5162 is a mostly monochrome field in the savanna of the [REDACTED] country, [REDACTED]. The grass of SCP-5162 seems to be a mixture of several shades of blue and gray, blueish gray trees with orange leaves are very prominent in SCP-5612. The inhabitants consist of bovine creatures, that seem to decay the longer you look at them, these bovine creatures are 5 meters tall and 3 meters wide, with horns that approximate to be 12 meters long and a foot wide, these bovine creatures are referred to as SCP-5162-1. Any other organisms that enter SCP-5612 become a blueish gray tint, remaining in SCP-5162-1 for a long periods of time infect the organism with a fungus refered to as SCP-5162-2, SCP-5162-2 infects and decays any organism(s) in scp-5152. If metal is put inside of SCP, it quickly rusts.
&lt;p&gt;It is unknown if SCP-5162-2 speeds up the organism(s) infected, or decays the organism(s).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If footage is taken of SCP-5162, it changes its color to match a normal savanna. But reviewing the footage of SCP-5162 it is back to its original state, but a organism refered to as SCP-5162-3 walks from behind a tree, presenting itself. SCP-5162-3 is a humanoid creature, that seems to be made out of SCP-5162-1’s skin, but twisted to make a humanoid shape, it has one glowing eye where it’s face should be, SCP-5162-3’s presence disorientates the audio and camera footage. SCP-5162-3 is usually docile, but if looking through a camera while taking footage of SCP-5162, it is hostile and attacks the viewer, infecting them with SCP-5162-2.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is theorized that SCP-5162 may be able to exterminate SCP-682, the theory is unlikely but there is still a chance it may be able to exterminate 682. Testing this theory is currently waiting for approval.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5162 was brought to the foundation’s attention by [REDACTED] a residence of [REDACTED]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The best containment method known to the SCP-foundation for SCP-5162 is creating a concrete barrier with the diameter 20 by 8 by 13 meters, and 24/7 surveillance. Only accessible by personnel approved by the 05-council.&lt;br /&gt;
No further information is known about SCP-5162&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bruead&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7127814&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608108776&quot; alt=&quot;Bruead&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7127814)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bruead&quot;  &gt;Bruead&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
