				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5461</guid>
				<title>SCP-5461</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5461</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5461&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Safe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5461-1 is to be contained inside a Storage Locker inside Site-76. All Instances of SCP-5461-2 are to be terminated if they are the following colors: Red, Purple, Indigo, Lime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5461-1 is a small plastic bag, of the variety usually used in candy stores to put self-served candy inside. Written on the &amp;quot;front&amp;quot; of the bag in Sharpie&lt;sup&gt;tm&lt;/sup&gt; brand marker is the incription, &#039;yumy gummie bear by dado&#039;. SCP-5461-1 holds a small amount of gummy bears, which are classified SCP-5461-2. SCP-5461-2 are mildly sapient, and possess different amounts of sentience,depending on their color. they are also capable of giving artificial feelings to those who consume. The following color categories are&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;wiki-content-table&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Color of SCP-5462-1&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Personality and Sentience&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Amnesty or Termination orders&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Red &#039;razzie bear&#039;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Extremely hostile, sentience equivalent to a five-year-old child.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;To be terminated immediately. subjects who eat describe &amp;quot;unabated anger.&amp;quot; and the taste of raspberry.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Orange &#039;ornagie bear&#039;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Sighs to itself and moves slowly. Sentience equivalent to a 15-year-old child&#039;s.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;To be given limited privileges and eaten after 5 days. subjects who eat describe feelings of &amp;quot;melancholy.&amp;quot; and the taste of orange.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Yellow &#039;sunshiney ber&#039;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Extremely effusive. Sentience of a 3-year-old child.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;To be given limited privileges and eaten after two weeks. subjects who eat describe a feeling of &amp;quot;extreme happiness.&amp;quot; and the taste of lemon.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Lime &#039;sour bar&#039;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Dour and annoyed. sentience of a 23-year-old adult, with chauvinistic views.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;To be terminated immediately. subjects who try describe a feeling of &amp;quot;annoyance, and suicidal views.&amp;quot; and the taste of lime.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Blue &#039;cool bear&#039;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Only instance wearing an article of clothing (glasses.) will walk around and attract other instances. Sentience of a 9-year-old child.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;To be given limited privileges, and killed after 3 days. subjects who eat describe feelings of &amp;quot;cool happiness.&amp;quot; and the taste of blueberry.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Indigo &#039;odd bear&#039;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Tries to eat other instances.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;To be Terminated immediately. Subjects who eat describe the feeling of &amp;quot;Estrangement.&amp;quot; along with the taste of poppy seeds. It is unknown why this taste is the one chosen.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Purple &#039;yucky bear&#039;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Disgusted, with an air of superiority. Sentience equivalent to a 15-year-old child.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;To be terminated immediately. subjects who eat describe a feeling of &amp;quot;toxicity.&amp;quot; along with the taste of [DATA EXPUNGED]&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Brown &#039;dark bear&#039;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Dark, broody. Keeps to itself.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;To be given limited privileges and eaten after 5 hours. Subjects describe a feeling of &amp;quot;disturbance.&amp;quot; and note the taste of Cocoa.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Clear &#039;brightie beear&#039;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Smart, large knowledge of the foundation.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;To be turned into Junior Researchers for the foundation. If eaten, subject will [DATA EXPUNGED], leaving large amount of flyers for &#039;dado&#039;s gumy bears&#039; all over the Testing Chamber&#039;s floor.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5461 was found in a warehouse registered to &#039;dado and friends&#039; in Burlington,Vermont, inside of a large cardboard box. Next to the box was a recently registered phone, known as a &amp;quot;burner&amp;quot; phone. On the phone was the following text stream. dado is shown in red, while the unidentified number is in blue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;display: inline-block ; border : dashed 1px #444444 ; background :#F5F5F5 ; margin-left : auto ; margin-right : auto ; width : 700px ; padding:10px&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;Hey, you there? dado?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;yes. this dado.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;how you doing?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;making pill. pill not good. so dado sad.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;So, you need a better pill?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;no. dado want something else, something happy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;So, like candy?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;yes. candy good. dado like good candy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;So make some candy!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;maybe. dado must think. dado wants special candy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;What kind of special?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;hm. dado think gumy bear. gumy bear yumy. yumy gumy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;That&#039;s it! gummies!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;not gummies. gumy. happy gumy, sad gumy, mad gumy. special gumy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;Ok? when do you think you&#039;ll have them?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;o. they done.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;Really?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;yes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;And they work?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;yes. dado wants to throw hamster.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;well, guess you ate a bad one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;this is dado. dado do good.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;Alright. I hope you enjoy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;thank you. I will give u some gumy. go to Burlington, 87th and main, the wearhouse. enjoy. just dont throw hamster.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;Ok,buddy. see you there.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footer-wikiwalk-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#171; &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5460&quot;&gt;SCP-5460&lt;/a&gt; | SCP-5461 | &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5462&quot;&gt;SCP-5462&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#187;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/theanimatefry&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5927653&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608108776&quot; alt=&quot;TheAnimateFry&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5927653)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/theanimatefry&quot;  &gt;TheAnimateFry&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
