style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: blue">Alright. I hope you enjoy.</span></p> </div> <p><span style="color: red">thank you. I will give u some gumy. go to Burlington, 87th and main, the wearhouse. enjoy. just dont throw hamster.</span></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="color: blue">Ok,buddy. see you there.</span></p> </div> </div> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5460">SCP-5460</a> | SCP-5461 | <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5462">SCP-5462</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/theanimatefry" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5927653&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608108776" alt="TheAnimateFry" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5927653)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/theanimatefry" >TheAnimateFry</a></span></p> 
