th: 80%; margin: auto;"> <p>Fortunately, my sister woke up. After waking up, She began to be in a trance. She cried and screamed, saying words that no one could understand.</p> <p>&quot;Youth passes as a fleeting river, star lies in the silver flower. &quot;</p> <p>This was the only sentence I could understand that my sister said on those days. The next day, doctor told us my sister can't be treated, because of her mental problem.</p> <p>Our parents took her back to Astra town. I could do nothing but go back to work. But, I can still hear the screaming of my sister, it became my deepest nightmare.</p> </div> <p><br /></p> <p>The entrance of the project is located in a cave at the bottom of ████ mountain. The area of 50 square meters around the mountain is covered with mist. After entering the entrance of the project, will step onto a narrow passage with a total length of about 70 meters. At the end of the passage, SCP-5179 is connected. The edge of SCP-5179 is inaccessible, so the cave at the bottom of ████ mountain is the only entrance and exit of the project.</p> <p><br /></p> <div style="padding: 10px; border: 2px solid black; width: 80%; margin: auto;"> <p>After days, my mother called me and told me to go back to Astra town. I stopped my work immediately and went back home. Everything was as usual. But, the flowers glowed brighter.</p> <p>I rushed into my sister's room. She lied in the bed, looking pale and haggard. &quot;Here you are, sister.&quot; She said with smile.</p> <p>The sunset at dusk sprinkled the last remnant mottle on the windowsill. I suddenly realized that it is the night of the new moon. Tears comes out from my sister's eyes.</p> <p>&quot;I'm scared, sister.&quot; She says.</p> </div> <p>SCP-5179-1 is the group designation for people in SCP-5179. SCP-5179-1 <em>is people living in town. Astra town is small, so everyone in town is like a family. It seemed like they all know about the situation of my sister, so the town was strangely quiet, even the naughtiest child in town didn't come out today.</em></p> <p><br /></p> <div style="padding: 10px; border: 2px solid black; width: 80%; margin: auto;"> <p>Her word is like a rose, it's weak and strengthless, but still stabs into my heart and makes it bleed. I dry her tears and attempt to comfort her.</p> <p>&quot;It'll be okay, there will be no pain, just like a dream&#8230;” I suddenly stop saying, because I've never experienced it, no one does, no one knows how it is like. What I just said was just my ridiculous fantasy about the unknown.</p> <p>&quot;No&#8230;The dreams&#8230;They were so scary&#8230;&quot;She says with a crying sound.</p> <p>I look at the window. The endless darkness covers the light, only stars are shining. The stars twinkle on the sky, make up the milky way. On one side of the milky way, it's the new moon. The moon is so fine that people ignore it carelessly.</p> </div> <p><br /></p> <p><strong>[NO LIFE SINGS MONITORED]</strong></p> <p><br /></p> <hr /> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> <p>I look into the room. My sister has stood up.<br /> &quot;The new moon has risen&#8230;It seems like I have no much time left.&quot; She says, &quot;Sister, you won't forget me, right?&quot;</p> <p>&quot;How will I? You're my only sister, I'll never forget you!&quot; I cry, trying to hug her.</p> <p>I touch her body, and find out that her body is cold as ice. Tears come out from her eyes again. The blue eyes of my sister is shining, so lucid, they reflect all the stars in the sky.</p> <p>Everything around me starts to get distorted. The whole room is surrounded by silvery, I am densed in the silver world, my mind is gradually swallowed by silver.</p> <p>I reach out my hand, but they go straight through my sister's body. Looking down, I only have a silver petal in my hand. The petal is warm, like first rays of the morning sun. The silvery around retreat in a sudden, everything restores slient. I look at my sister&#8230;</p> <p>Sister? Isn't me the only child in my family?</p> <p>I look at the photo of my family. On the picture, my father is smiling, hugging me when I was young with my mother. Beside my mother, it's an empty baby carriage.</p> <p>That's right, there are only three people in my family.</p> <p>In this silent night, the stars are clearly visible in the sky. The flowers in town are blooming, embellishing the small town.</p> <p>Youth passes as a fleeting river, star lies in the silver flower.</p> <p>I pick up a fallen petal. Beneath the silver, I see all the stars.</p> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5178">SCP-5178</a> | SCP-5179 | <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5180">SCP-5180</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alkaid-talloran" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6455532&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608108776" alt="Alkaid Talloran" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6455532)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alkaid-talloran" >Alkaid Talloran</a></span></p> 
